  <data name="Settings_PrivacyLastUpdated" xml:space="preserve"><value>Last updated: October 8, 2026</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hatch stores your tasks locally by default. Sync is optional and requires you to sign in.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyUserDataHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>User data</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyUserDataMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Tasks and custom lists are stored in tasks.json; app preferences are stored in settings.json. Both files stay on your device in %LocalAppData%\Hatch\. Startup and unhandled exceptions may write diagnostic details to %LocalAppData%\Hatch\crash.log. This file stays on your device and is not sent automatically. Exception details may contain task data.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacySyncHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Optional sync</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacySyncMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sync is off by default and requires sign-in. If enabled, only your tasks and lists are sent to the sync service; device and usage data are not. Tasks and lists are encrypted on this device before upload. You can turn sync off in Settings.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyTelemetryHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Analytics and telemetry</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyTelemetryMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hatch has no analytics, telemetry, or remote crash reporting.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyNetworkHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Internet access</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyNetworkMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hatch works without an internet connection. It makes no network requests without your action: signing in to sync, checking for updates, opening the Microsoft Store review page, or opening GitHub issues.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacySharingHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data sharing</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacySharingMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hatch does not sell or share data with advertisers or analytics providers. Sync data is sent to Hatch's sync service only when you opt in.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyChildrenHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Children's privacy</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyChildrenMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hatch does not knowingly collect data from children. It has no social features or public user-generated content.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyContactHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Contact</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_PrivacyContactMessage" xml:space="preserve"><value>For questions or concerns, open an issue at github.com/fbtwitter/hatch/issues.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings_TermsDialogTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Terms and conditions</value></data>
