  <data name="Calendar_ReminderDialogBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>Timed events get a Windows reminder 10 minutes before they start. All-day events stay silent.

Hatch checks for changes every 5 minutes while running, including in the tray. Events can be out of date until the next successful refresh.

Scheduled reminders can appear after Hatch closes, but reschedules and cancellations cannot sync while it is closed. Reminders can be missed while the PC is asleep or off.

Imported .ics files are snapshots of the previous 7 days and next 30 days at import time. They never refresh automatically. Use Replace file in the calendar's options menu to load changes, cancellations and later dates. Replacement replaces every event in that imported source.</value></data>
